      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OFF TO SCHOOL (5) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by one length at this track in a handy 17.24 beating Manado's Girl. Jumping from the pinch draw but has the ability and in winning form. Great chance to get the job done again. TELLING TALES (3) was game in defeat off a low draw at the latest outing, finishing second and beaten 1.5 lengths (17.28) behind Orana Jet at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Hard to beat again. DODGY WILLOW (1) collided with another runner and was out of the placings when a 3.5 lengths fourth (17.59) in a Novice race at this track. Expected to feature on best. SHINE OVER ME (8) must be respected at her pet track and distance.",
